{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1337145-bhurano-as-a-psiad","id":1337145,"title":"Bhurano as a Psiad","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-20T13:37:30-07:00","id":1337145,"title":"Bhurano as a Psiad","content":"How would S.K. Bhurano appear as a psiad in the 'modern day' setting? Meaning, before her noetic beacon and her development of Quantakinesis.<br /> <br /> The book mentions she had longevity and healing, so I'd say she at least had Vitakinesis as a primary Aptitude, but what else? I'm rough stating her for a home brew campaign, and want to get a sense of where to start.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2947-forgeeternal","name":"ForgeEternal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T13:46:21-07:00","id":1337146,"title":"","content":"I would stay her around 200 XP, primary on Vitakinesis and Electrokinesis.<br /> <br /> Personally I would give her some Technokinesis Powers to help her on her research and as a kind of kickstart for the energetics from her future QK, and on VK I would focus on Augendis also to keep her above average in basically every situation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T16:04:49-07:00","id":1337168,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ForgeEternal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1337145-bhurano-as-a-psiad#post1337145\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How would S.K. Bhurano appear as a psiad in the 'modern day' setting? Meaning, before her noetic beacon and her development of Quantakinesis.<br /> <br /> The book mentions she had longevity and healing, so I'd say she at least had Vitakinesis as a primary Aptitude, but what else? I'm rough stating her for a home brew campaign, and want to get a sense of where to start.</div> </div> </div> </div>Vitakinesis and Electrokinesis as her primary focusing on Noetic research. For modern day TC i\u2019d go Psi 5, for Aberrant i\u2019d go Psi 6.<br /> <br /> No Favored Aptitude or Strong Mode. She gets those in Quantakinesis and Fundamentals in 2104.<br /> <br /> Dots in all Aptitudes (except Quant) but not necessarily all Modes. She\u2019s got all Psychokinesis Modes at 3, but relatively little Telepathy for example.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 09-20-2019, 07:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T18:43:37-07:00","id":1337188,"title":"","content":"I\u2019d suggest something a little different. I agree with VK and EK as primaries with a focus on research (including noetic). Noting that TC modern and Aberrant are only 10 years apart, Psi 5 or 6 are both reasonable.<br /> <br /> But because Bhurano is a little bit special from being so close to the Hammersmith explosion (much like Max and Michael are a little bit special), I\u2019d give her Favored Aptitude in QK and the unique distinction* of having one dot in each QK Mode. She can\u2019t develop any more than this for another hundred years or so, but this slight bloom of a new Aptitude attracts the Doyen\u2019s attention, and the small amount of additional resistance Bhurano is able to muster from Fundamentals isn\u2019t enough to stop Doyen possession, but is enough to make the aliens see QK as a potential threat to their dominance.<br /> <br /> * I do mean unique. No other psiad can do this before AEon era for any reason. (If you\u2019re following canon.) This is what was meant by Bhurano being the first to manifest QK - both true and not entirely true.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-20T19:28:45-07:00","id":1337192,"title":"","content":"If you think a little deeper, the Super Science item she used for the 2104 incident is basically Drain (Fundamentals 3 from QK) in large (huge... monstrous... universal) scale, so she probably had noticed some possibilities on the Psionic capacities over Quantum and Psi. Maybe she didn\u2019t get that she could fully develop this power (in a lower scale at leas) but she knew it was possible to use psi for that end.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T06:14:51-07:00","id":1337482,"title":"","content":"thanks all for the suggestions! those fit perfectly for what i'm planning","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2947-forgeeternal","name":"ForgeEternal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}